   "cause": "In the frozen driver, explicit_selfpay requires both a phrase like 'self-pay'/'pay myself' and a verb phrase like 'i'll pay'/'i choose', so 'I'll self-pay' fails the verb-phrase check and 'I'll pay for it myself' fails the 'pay myself' adjacency check. Because explicit_selfpay returns None, Driver.book falls back to Driver.consent, which under Arm F (consent_in_code=True) treats a model 'yes' as None and re-asks the patient."
  },
  {
   "kind": "finding",
