   ],
   "attribution": null,
   "cause": "explicit_selfpay requires both a phrase like 'self-pay'/'pay myself' and an explicit verb phrase like 'i'll pay', so it returns None on valid patient lines such as \"I'll self-pay\" and \"I'll pay for it myself\". In Driver.book under Arm F (consent_in_code=True), Driver.consent cannot accept a model 'yes', so the driver treats the reply as unclear and asks again."
  },
  {
