   "cause": "In clinicbench/adapters/dcitl_port.py, explicit_selfpay requires both a self-pay phrase (e.g. 'self-pay' or 'pay myself') and a separate commitment verb phrase (e.g. 'i'll pay'), so it returns None for 'I'll self-pay' and 'I'll pay for it myself'. In Driver.book, sp=None falls back to Driver.consent, which under Arm F (consent_in_code=True) ignores a model 'yes' and triggers Driver.unclear to re-ask the patient."
